# Static overlay, 64x64 tileable, 3 frames. Honour the "reduce flashing"
# option (ui.options.reduce_flashing): show one frame, no flicker.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 64 64
@output ../fx/fx_static.png
@preview ../previews/fx_static_x4.png 4
@columns 3

# tileable static for jump-scare moments (alternate fast, keep under 3 flashes/s)
